1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:02,400
A Moon landing slips by one week.

2
00:00:02,500 --> 00:00:04,150
What changes on the ground?

3
00:00:04,280 --> 00:00:06,620
Compare three arrivals with the same stay:

4
00:00:06,740 --> 00:00:09,050
